Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat(mac-shell): a script about macOS's dialogs names
 whose it means to press on

lib.sh takes a press that lands on an alert or a dialog of macOS's for one that missed Arbor, and counts it as a failed
check, unless the dialog's process began after the run. check-download.sh presses Gatekeeper's dialogs on purpose: with
an agent that was running already, a good download would have been held back. ARBOR_PRESSES_ON names the owners that are
meant; everything else about a press stays.
---
